        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Prior to its sale on January 31, 2026, through our Call Solutions business, we offered a live-agent capability and maintained call-ready data records, which served as a marketplace that connected consumers with our advertiser clients.",
        "start_character": 17286,
        "end_character": 17520
      },
      {
