        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through AdParlor, we operate our non-core business which offers advertiser clients managed-service creator marketing and media buying across social media platforms.",
        "start_character": 17799,
        "end_character": 17963
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010679",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010679-639f88c3bf8db979",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010679",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to continue to invest in both sales efforts and product development to grow our media network and extend our product offering to capture more touch points in the consumer journey.",
        "start_character": 20822,
        "end_character": 21011
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010679",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010679-639f88c3bf8db979",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010679",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we hold two annual programs that add meaningful value that focus on mental/physical health and development.",
        "start_character": 34684,
        "end_character": 34805
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010679",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010679-639f88c3bf8db979",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010679",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we operated a call center-supported performance marketplace (\"Call Solutions\") that provided live, call-based performance campaigns to help clients increase customer acquisition.",
        "start_character": 3970,
        "end_character": 4162
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010679",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010679-639f88c3bf8db979",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010679",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "From internal Fluent University courses to company-wide workshops and memberships to corporate networking organizations, such as She Runs It, we offer continuous opportunities for personal and professional development.",
        "start_character": 33724,
        "end_character": 33942
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010679",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010679-639f88c3bf8db979",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010679",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Outside of the United States, we own and operate consumer facing websites in the United Kingdom (the \"UK\"), Canada, and Australia and are subject to the laws, rules, and regulations of those countries as they impact our operations.",
        "start_character": 26670,
        "end_character": 26901
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010679",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010679-639f88c3bf8db979",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010679",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We access these consumers through both our commerce media marketplace (\"Commerce Media Solutions\"), which delivers targeted advertising within e-commerce and digital media transaction flows on partner sites and mobile apps, and our owned and operated digital media properties (\"O&O Sites\").",
        "start_character": 895,
        "end_character": 1185
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010679",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010679-639f88c3bf8db979",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010679",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also subject to laws, rules, and regulations regarding data collection, AI, privacy and data security, intellectual property ownership and infringement, and promotions and taxation, among others.",
        "start_character": 26119,
        "end_character": 26321
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010679",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010679-639f88c3bf8db979",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010679",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate our Commerce Media Solutions on partner sites and mobile apps where we embed our proprietary ad-serving technology to identify and acquire consumers for our advertiser clients.",
        "start_character": 1505,
        "end_character": 1692
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-010679",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-010679-639f88c3bf8db979",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-010679",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
